OL,3,GNEWSARiver project could reshape
OL,4,AEngland's waterways
OL,5,
OL,6,FRestoring rivers and wetlands could
OL,7,Fdeliver billions of pounds in economic
OL,8,Fbenefits while improving wildlife
OL,9,Fhabitats and helping communities cope
OL,10,Fwith flooding and climate change, a
OL,11,Freport says.
OL,13,FThe Rivers 2040 Vision has been
OL,14,Fpublished by the Wildlife Trusts, Trent
OL,15,FRivers Trust and Intact Insurance.
OL,17,FIt estimates that investing #43m a year
OL,18,Fin restoring the River Trent over the
OL,19,Fnext 30 years could generate about
OL,20,F#10bn in economic benefits.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
