OL,3,GNEWSARiver project could reshape
OL,4,AEngland's waterways
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report says the river, which is
OL,7,Fabout 350km long and passes through
OL,8,FStaffordshire and six other counties,
OL,9,Fcould be a blueprint for how waterways
OL,10,Facross England could be restored.
